              "default": "live",
              "description": "live or eval. Eval writes no request, claim, work item, label or comment: it decides the issue named by number as it was opened, as if no run had seen it, shows triage only its title and body at creation, and returns every field of the decision as the outcome's evaluation. Any other value refuses the run at facts, before anything is read or written."
            },
            "trust": {
              "default": "auto",
              "description": "auto or outside. Outside decides the item as an outside author's whatever the maintainer list says, and refuses an item whose trust is already recorded as maintainer, because recorded trust never changes. There is no maintainer value: any other value refuses the run at facts, before anything is read or written, so no input can raise trust."
            }
